{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of the below expression?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e217318c76e0e4507991dbf268c920a926a0a93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{\\sqrt{9} + \\sqrt{15} + \\sqrt{49}} - \\sqrt{\\sqrt{3} + \\sqrt{49} - \\sqrt{75}}\\]\" width=\"327\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/3039835a24ea37f752ad461b3182bfe315116974.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2\\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"400\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplify the basic terms: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dcba07bde5741ce967fc1b96296720f986e6375.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{9}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab4630d024cfbf089743201fc79696b39ce8013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{49}=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/d/2ed7f004c920aaa0394703c7256ce2ae86fb3d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{75}=5\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Substitute them into the expression:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/b/c3b39b507a6b8b8ff84c8738afa4b02014b4b678.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{3 + \\sqrt{15} + 7} - \\sqrt{\\sqrt{3} + 7 - 5\\sqrt{3}}\\]\" width=\"264\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/c/a0c603d848f2b9f741a23ec5dcfb0447c3d273fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{10 + \\sqrt{15}} - \\sqrt{7 - 4\\sqrt{3}}\\]\" width=\"195\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>Simplify the second radical using a perfect square:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/c/bec4f8aa5bb171f2c16c8645706b66a35b5d30b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{7 - 4\\sqrt{3}} = \\sqrt{(2 - \\sqrt{3})^2} = 2 - \\sqrt{3}\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>Substitute back&#160;:\n<span style=\"color:red\">$$ (Error compiling LaTeX. Unknown error_msg)</span>\\sqrt{10 + \\sqrt{15}} - (2 - \\sqrt{3})\n</p><p>The correct answer is C.\n</p><p>~Icosahedron0288\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems\">2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034402\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.550 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 53/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip